<title>UK: SPV Fidelio Trust No.3 adds 55 mln marks to bond.</title>
<headline>SPV Fidelio Trust No.3 adds 55 mln marks to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by lead manager HSBC Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPV FIDELIO TRUST NO.3</p>
<p> AMT   *55 MLN DEM    COUPON   **18.50     MATURITY    01.MAR.15</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-DOWN ISS PRICE  UNDISC    PAY DATE ***28.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *FUNGIBLE WITH OUTSTANDING 95 MLN MARKS LAUNCHED ON</p>
<p>		24.MAR.97 AMD INCREASED ON 10.APR.97</p>
<p>	    **TO 01.MAR.00 AND THEN 10.25 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>	   ***PLUS 41 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>		REDEMPTION IN 10 EQUAL INSTALMENTS FROM 01.MAR.06</p>
<p>		UNDERLYING BONDS ARE REPUBLIC OF ECUADOR US$ PDI</p>
<p>		BONDS DUE 2015</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
